### IntelliJ HTTP Client - rode a aplicacao e clique no triangulo verde de cada requisicao

### 1) POST - cria uma receita (201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8080/transacoes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "descricao": "Salario",
  "valor": 3500.00,
  "tipo": "RECEITA",
  "categoria": "Trabalho"
}

### 2) POST - cria uma despesa acima do limite (gera ALERTA DE GASTO no log)
POST http://localhost:8080/transacoes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "descricao": "Aluguel",
  "valor": 1200.00,
  "tipo": "DESPESA",
  "categoria": "Moradia"
}

### 3) GET - lista tudo (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/transacoes

### 4) GET por id existente (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/transacoes/1

### 5) GET por id inexistente (404 Not Found + ERRO no log)
GET http://localhost:8080/transacoes/999

### 6) PUT - atualiza (200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:8080/transacoes/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "descricao": "Aluguel (reajustado)",
  "valor": 1300.00,
  "tipo": "DESPESA",
  "categoria": "Moradia"
}

### 7) PUT inexistente (404)
PUT http://localhost:8080/transacoes/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "descricao": "Teste",
  "valor": 10.00,
  "tipo": "DESPESA"
}

### 8) DELETE (204 No Content)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/transacoes/2

### 9) DELETE inexistente (404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/transacoes/999

### 10) Resumo (receitas, despesas, saldo, alertaGasto)
GET http://localhost:8080/transacoes/resumo

### 11) Validacao (400 Bad Request + ERRO no log)
POST http://localhost:8080/transacoes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "descricao": "",
  "valor": -5,
  "tipo": "DESPESA"
}
